Please read below Article 2 of Tax Treaty and necessary improvement. 

Article 2
Taxes Covered
1. The taxes which are the subject of this Convention are:
In the United Kingdom of Great Britain and Northern Ireland:
(i) the income tax;
(ii) the corporation tax;
(iii) the capital gains tax;
(hereinafter referred to as "United Kingdom tax");
In the Islamic Republic of Pakistan:
(i) the income tax;
(ii) the super-tax;
(iii) the surcharge; (hereinafter referred to as "Pakistan tax").

